  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: 「〜」⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{言|い}う (say '~') or X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{言|い}う (say X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing or repeated action. {言|い}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is saying' or 'has been saying.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 「〜」⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{言|い}う (say '~' - quotation)\n- 〜⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{言|い}われて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (it is said that ~)\n- ⟦{言|い}い{方|かた}→言い方：14165_iikata⟧ (way of saying)\n- ⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{言|い}えば (speaking of)\n\nCompare: ⟦{話|はな}す→話す：00467_hanasu⟧ emphasizes conversation/storytelling, while {言|い}う focuses on the specific words uttered.",
